{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026UXfmqTCxWu1795647274.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國富商馬斯克旗下的SpaceX，獲美國政府批准建立太空數據中心。此外，SpaceX又宣布向「特朗普帳戶」人士捐贈SpaceX股份。</p><p></p><p>美國聯邦通信委員會已批准SpaceX的「Starmind」計劃，把100萬顆人工智能運算衛星送入軌道。聯邦通信委員會主席卡爾表示，有關計劃可以擴大美國在人工智能領域的領先優勢。</p><p></p><p>此外，SpaceX宣布向每個「特朗普帳戶」，即美國未成年人士投資儲蓄帳戶，捐贈1股SpaceX股份，馬斯克個人承諾等額配捐。特朗普帳戶已達7,000萬個，以SpaceX收市價127.44元計，SpaceX及馬斯克的送股計劃總值超過178億美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T23:57:37.245368+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":278,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T22:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T21:57:37.284453+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T23:50:52.796432+00:00","content_hash":"6d641546a3366c5d2d7dbef34184c3f2a2dc5c89ca68eccaa97604aa4d535448","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T23:57:37.245368+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}